---
# Static Linux — Calamares job: LUKS2 sanity checks.
# Best-effort — the actual encryption setup is Calamares' own core partition
# module. This runs late (after partition + bootloader, before "umount") and
# only checks/warns; it never rewrites bootloader or mkinitcpio config itself
# (CRITICAL RULE: no irreversible changes without a clear owner of the undo).
type:       "job"
name:       "luks"
interface:  "python"
script:     "main.py"
